<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSS Demo</title>

    <style>

        body{
            background-color:#f4f4f4;
            font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
        }

        .container{
            width:80%;
            margin:30px auto;
            background:white;
            padding:20px;
            border:3px solid green;
            border-radius:10px;
        }

        h1{
            text-align:center;
            color:green;
        }

        .box{
            background:#d9fdd3;
            margin:20px;
            padding:20px;
            border:2px solid darkgreen;
            border-radius:10px;
        }

        ul{
            background:#fff3cd;
            padding:15px;
            border:2px solid orange;
        }

        ol{
            background:#d1ecf1;
            padding:15px;
            border:2px solid blue;
        }

        li{
            margin:10px;
        }

        .box:hover{
            background:#c3f7b5;
        }

    </style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>Welcome to HTML & CSS Demo</h1>

    <div class="box">
        <h2>About HTML</h2>

        <p>
            HTML is used to create web pages. CSS is used to design web pages.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
        <h2>HTML Topics</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Headings</li>
            <li>Paragraphs</li>
            <li>Images</li>
            <li>Links</li>
            <li>Tables</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
        <h2>CSS Topics</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>Color</li>
            <li>Margin</li>
            <li>Padding</li>
            <li>Border</li>
            <li>Background</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
